error[E5007]: a closure that captures the reference 'count' cannot escape
  --> main.prism:6:42
    6 | fun f(count: &MutableState<Int>) { later { count.value += 1 } }
      |                                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ passed to an escaping parameter here
  --> main.prism:6:44
    6 | fun f(count: &MutableState<Int>) { later { count.value += 1 } }
      |                                            ^^^^^ 'count' is captured here
   = note: a closure that escapes owns what it captures, and a reference cannot be owned
   = help: make a weak reference before the closure, 'val countRef = count.weak()', and use 'countRef.get()' inside it
